      "text": "Monitoring\n- observe whole production,\nindividual machines\n- run in Threads, multiple at\nonce possible\n- ingest data from\ncontainers, which both have\nsame MQTT interface\n- compare simulation results",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "kW0fdsxNGcgBNsshfmGOu",
      "originalText": "Monitoring\n- observe whole production, individual machines\n- run in Threads, multiple at once possible\n- ingest data from containers, which both have same MQTT interface\n- compare simulation results",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
